I walk over to the glass counter.
It is full of cakes and bread.
I look at the many things.
They look very delicious.
There are small signs next to the cakes.
The signs are handwritten.
I read the Danish words.
I read them very slowly.
I understand the text on the signs.
There is a large chocolate cake.
But I look at another piece of pastry.
It is a large cinnamon roll.
It has a lot of sugar on top.
I love the taste of cinnamon.
It is perfect for a cold winter day.
I would very much like to have the cinnamon roll.
Now I am ready to order.
